--   This bundle defines, for complex $q$, the totalized complex-valued function $f(q)=\big(\prod_{n\ge1}(1-q^n)\big)^3$ and the triangular-exponent sum $g(q)=\sum_{n\ge0}(-1)^n(2n+1)q^{n(n+1)/2}$. It also defines two formal multilinear series on $\mathbb{C}$ built from scalar coefficient sequences, one with coefficients given by the Jacobi triple sign and one by the cube convolution of pentagonal signs. They serve to compare formal and analytic sides of Jacobi's identity $(q;q)_\infty^3=g(q)$.
